post-it: Icons don't open
cause: Screenshot set as wallpaper
symptoms:
	Icons don't open
	Can't open pictures
	Programs won't start
checks:
	no: Desktop icons open
	yes: Picture is clean
	no: Wallpaper is a normal picture
		shows: Display Properties calls it "prank"
	no: Icons are on the desktop
		shows: bottom right, mostly off the screen
software steps:
	Double-click the folder in the corner of the desktop
	Drag the icons in it out onto the desktop
	Right-click the desktop, click Properties, pick a Wallpaper, click OK
